          "info": {
            "name": "Apply Model Family Handler",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/settings/apply-model-family",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Apply a model family by fanning it out into the per-role model settings.\n\nPersists concrete values for the agent roles (flagship) and knowledge\nimport (economy tier). The family itself is not persisted — it is only a\ntransient way to propagate these per-role defaults. Re-running this\noverwrites those roles; users can still set explicit per-role overrides\nafterwards."
        },
